      "widgets_values": [
        "Use the supplied image as the exact character reference: preserve the same adult face, body proportions and outfit of one adult courier with a short asymmetrical black bob, a small ivory crescent pin at the left temple, a muted coral raincoat with one large patch pocket, navy trousers and navy boots. Exactly one ivory paper star, the same object throughout the story. S01: three-quarter wide full-body shot. One hand is at the large raincoat pocket, extracting the folded ivory paper star, with clear finger-to-star contact. Show face, pocket and hand together; star just emerging from the pocket. Quiet ink-navy night background, dark foreground silhouette, ample empty space along the star's future path. Hand-drawn controlled ink contours, refined flat cel shading, subtle print grain, strong cinematic light-and-shadow shapes, dimensional staging through foreground and background silhouettes, original animated-film still quality. Restrained ink navy, muted coral, ivory and cool blue-gray palette. Adult proportions and expressive believable hands; no kawaii icon, paper puppet, simple vector sticker, photorealism or 3D doll. No letters, logos or watermark."
      ]
